@local/dsh-code-review README · dsh-code-review：On-demand code review for [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness).
`/review` audits the uncommitted changes of the workspace with a reviewer model and
renders the report as a card in the conversation.

@local/dsh-code-review README · Use：A name that does not resolve — `mode=`, `reasoningEffort=` — is refused before any
model call, with the names that do resolve listed. The reviewer never reads the
conversation.
